{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UNLEASH YOUR INNER DRAGON IN THIS THRILLING SIDE-SCROLLING BRAWLER!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Heroes of Mount Dragon</i>, you\u2019ll step into the shoes of one of 8 unique heroes who can transform into powerful dragons! Whether you\u2019re teaming up with friends or battling solo, prepare for fast-paced, side-scrolling combat against hordes of enemies. With intuitive controls and a deep set of moves, you\u2019ll face off in epic battles, unleash devastating combos, and unlock powerful upgrades as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/02_Dragons.gif?t=1744724120\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DRAGON-MORPHING\u00a0 HEROES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 8* unique heroes, each with their own abilities and fighting styles. Unlock your hero's power and transform into a mighty dragon to take on increasingly tough enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*4 available heroes at Launch</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/01_Combat.gif?t=1744724120\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EPIC, DYNAMIC COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle through relentless waves of enemies by mastering your hero's unique moves, dragon transformations, and powerful upgrades. A true test of your skills awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/03_Competitive.gif?t=1744724120\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> CHALLENGE YOURSELF OR TEAM UP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against enemies solo or join up with up to 3 friends for couch co-op or online action in Adventure mode or exciting score-based competitive showdowns. Team up to defeat evil or compete for supremacy in fun, action-packed matches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/04_Curses.gif?t=1744724120\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UNLEASH HILARIOUS CURSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a variety of devious curses to mess with your rivals\u2014electrify them, shrink them, or flip their controls. Disrupt gameplay and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/05_Art_Style.gif?t=1744724120\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A HAND-DRAWN WORLD IN 3D</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vibrant 2D realms, crafted with numerous unique hand-drawn textures, are seamlessly integrated into a 3D environment, creating a world full of layered depth and visual charm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ARE YOU READY FOR THE ULTIMATE DRAGON SHOWDOWN?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/discord-EN.png?t=1744724120\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/newsletter-EN.png?t=1744724120\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2733070?t=1744724120","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744724120","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744724120","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17